just test` stops failing on a busy host: the suite-gate [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]integration test bounds child pytest lifecycles by observable [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]progress instead of idle-host wall clocks, and ACE PNG snapshots [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]can no longer capture a stable-but-unfinished frame.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]just_test_contention_flakes.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/just_test_contention_flakes.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-e9[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-e9/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Load-tolerant suite-gate integration budgets[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]gate[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate: replace the fixed 60s/20s/10s/15s wall clocks in the suite-gate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]integration test with budgets calibrated from measured child admission [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]latency, and fail with child diagnostics instead of a bare [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]TimeoutExpired.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Close the ACE visual convergence gap[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]visual[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual: stop Textual animations from running under PNG snapshot tests [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and teach the convergence helper to treat pending animations as [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unfinished work, so a starved app cannot present five identical [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mid-animation frames.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Revalidate and record the contention baseline[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]baseline[dim] · [dim][/dim]after gate, visual[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]baseline: rerun the visual contention harness and the suite-gate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]integration test under load, confirm both phases hold together, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refresh the recorded harness baseline.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-e9","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","phase_bead_id":"sase-e9.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-e9de9bdbc1c1f5d7e4f4cfa680f94485","started_at":"2026-08-02T14:19:20.748965+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"a71e828c9d7d4266d44bf7d74bf1130d1d536112acbba71b96d4bba44d7b8ef9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-e9.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"13657ed82303f653c3c2667fc06ecb17bf4ece3c9d8700192a5d229ab74cb0af","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-e9.land/meta.json","size_bytes":580},"prompt":{"digest":"a6183703d2f9d9af3d2eafdaffe1aca1a8b36661ec468199b146436dfd75b759","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-e9.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":197},"state":{"digest":"7f857e37b6c08a42fe957deb109807ef187fd1c215f7c7b4594f433b1c1bb1aa","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-e9.land/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-e9.land","local_name":"sase-e9.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-e9","agent_clan_generation":"20260802101736","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-e9","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-e9","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-eec6c9d2951d17dda8beabef